#: ../../source/getting-started.md:1
msgid "Getting Started"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:3
msgid ""
"Use this guide to install q2m3 from source and run H2 validation. Start with these small examples"
" before the high-memory Catalyst diagnostics."
msgstr "使用本指南从源码安装 q2m3 并运行 H2 验证。先完成这些小规模示例，再尝试高内存 Catalyst 诊断。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:6
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:8
msgid ""
"q2m3 targets Python 3.11 or newer and uses `uv` for environment management. The core package "
"requires PySCF, PennyLane, NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib, and Rich. Optional workflows add SQD, "
"Catalyst/JAX, GPU backends, and molecular visualization tools."
msgstr ""
"q2m3 面向 Python 3.11 或更新版本，并使用 `uv` 管理环境。核心包要求 PySCF、PennyLane、NumPy、SciPy、Matplotlib 和 "
"Rich。可选工作流增加 SQD、Catalyst/JAX、GPU 后端及分子可视化工具。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Need"
msgstr "需求"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Install command"
msgstr "安装命令"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Core package only"
msgstr "仅核心包"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync`"
msgstr "`uv sync`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Development tools"
msgstr "开发工具"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync --extra dev`"
msgstr "`uv sync --extra dev`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Sample-based quantum diagonalization"
msgstr "基于采样的量子对角化"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync --frozen --extra sqd`"
msgstr "`uv sync --frozen --extra sqd`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Catalyst solvation workflow"
msgstr "Catalyst 溶剂化工作流"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync --extra catalyst --extra solvation`"
msgstr "`uv sync --extra catalyst --extra solvation`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Documentation build"
msgstr "文档构建"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync --frozen --extra docs --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz`"
msgstr "`uv sync --frozen --extra docs --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "Full local development set"
msgstr "完整本地开发依赖"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md
msgid "`uv sync --frozen --extra dev --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz`"
msgstr "`uv sync --frozen --extra dev --extra sqd --extra catalyst --extra solvation --extra viz`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:23
msgid ""
"GPU support is optional. The `gpu` extra installs CUDA-oriented packages. Use it only on machines"
" with compatible NVIDIA drivers and CUDA runtime support."
msgstr "GPU 支持为可选项。`gpu` 可选依赖安装面向 CUDA 的软件包。仅在具有兼容 NVIDIA 驱动和 CUDA 运行时支持的机器上使用。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:27
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:36
msgid "`uv run` automatically uses the managed `.venv`, so activating the environment is optional."
msgstr "`uv run` 自动使用受管理的 `.venv`，因此可以不激活环境。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:39
msgid "First Validation"
msgstr "首次验证"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:41
msgid "Start with the small H2 examples. They test the same public APIs as the larger workflows."
msgstr "从小规模 H2 示例开始。它们测试与较大工作流相同的公开 API。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:49
msgid "The maintained H2 validation script does three things:"
msgstr "维护中的 H2 验证脚本执行三项检查："

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:51
msgid "It checks vacuum and MM-embedded Hamiltonians."
msgstr "检查真空和 MM 嵌入哈密顿量。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:52
msgid "It compares PySCF Hartree-Fock references with QPE estimates."
msgstr "比较 PySCF Hartree-Fock 参考值和 QPE 估计值。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:53
msgid "It reports the solvation stabilization in kcal/mol after explicit conversion from Hartree."
msgstr "从 Hartree 显式转换后，以 kcal/mol 报告溶剂化稳定能。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:56
msgid "Quick API Check"
msgstr "快速 API 检查"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:58
msgid ""
"The package-level constants are Python floats. You can use them in pure Python, NumPy, and code "
"that supplies values to Catalyst."
msgstr "包级常量为 Python 浮点数，可用于纯 Python、NumPy 以及向 Catalyst 提供数值的代码。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:66
msgid "Runtime And Memory Tiers"
msgstr "运行时间与内存层级"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:68
msgid ""
"Do not run every script in `examples/` as a smoke test. Catalyst compile memory scales with "
"estimation wires, Trotter depth, and Hamiltonian term count."
msgstr "不要将 `examples/` 中的全部脚本作为冒烟测试。Catalyst 编译内存随估计线路数、Trotter 深度和哈密顿量项数增长。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Tier"
msgstr "层级"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Scripts"
msgstr "脚本"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Expected environment"
msgstr "预期环境"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "First run"
msgstr "首次运行"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "`h2_qpe_validation.py`, `h2_resource_estimation.py`"
msgstr "`h2_qpe_validation.py`、`h2_resource_estimation.py`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "CPU laptop or workstation"
msgstr "CPU 笔记本或工作站"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Standard MC"
msgstr "标准 MC"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "`h2_mc_solvation.py`"
msgstr "`h2_mc_solvation.py`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Catalyst/JAX installed. 8 GB+ RAM recommended"
msgstr "已安装 Catalyst/JAX。建议至少 8 GB 内存"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "H3O+ MC"
msgstr "H3O+ MC"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "`h3o_mc_solvation.py`"
msgstr "`h3o_mc_solvation.py`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Catalyst/JAX installed. 16 GB+ RAM recommended"
msgstr "已安装 Catalyst/JAX。建议至少 16 GB 内存"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "High-memory diagnostics"
msgstr "高内存诊断"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "`h3o_8bit_qpe_benchmark.py`, `h3o_dynamic_trotter_oom_scan.py`, `qpe_memory_profile.py`"
msgstr "`h3o_8bit_qpe_benchmark.py`、`h3o_dynamic_trotter_oom_scan.py`、`qpe_memory_profile.py`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "30 GB+ RAM recommended. Use provided guards/options"
msgstr "建议至少 30 GB 内存。使用提供的保护机制和选项"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:78
msgid "Basic Solvation Run"
msgstr "基本溶剂化运行"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:84
msgid ""
"This command runs fixed-mode H2 MC solvation with IR caching. The first run may compile Catalyst "
"IR. Later runs can reuse the cache when the circuit structure does not change."
msgstr "该命令运行启用 IR 缓存的 fixed 模式 H2 MC 溶剂化。首次运行可能编译 Catalyst IR；当电路结构不变时，后续运行可复用缓存。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:88
msgid "First SQD Run"
msgstr "首次 SQD 运行"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:90
msgid ""
"SQD currently requires Linux x86_64 and a source checkout. Set native numerical thread counts "
"before Python starts. The calibrated resource model covers serial execution."
msgstr "SQD 目前要求 Linux x86_64 和源码仓库。在 Python 启动前设置原生数值线程数。校准资源模型覆盖串行执行。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:99
msgid ""
"This four-qubit H₂ case is a convention and integration regression: its sampled subspace reaches "
"all four determinants. Continue with the [SQD showcase tutorial](tutorials/sqd-showcase.md) for "
"sparse glycine runs, authenticated integral input, and fixed point-charge embedding."
msgstr ""
"这个四量子比特 H₂ 案例检查约定和集成回归：其采样子空间达到全部四个行列式。继续阅读 [SQD 展示教程](tutorials/sqd-"
"showcase.md)，了解稀疏甘氨酸运行、经过认证的积分输入和固定点电荷嵌入。"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:104
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Likely cause"
msgstr "可能原因"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Import error for `catalyst` or `jax`"
msgstr "导入 `catalyst` 或 `jax` 出错"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Solvation extras are missing"
msgstr "缺少溶剂化可选依赖"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Run `uv sync --extra catalyst --extra solvation`"
msgstr "运行 `uv sync --extra catalyst --extra solvation`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Import error for `ffsim` or `qiskit_addon_sqd`"
msgstr "导入 `ffsim` 或 `qiskit_addon_sqd` 出错"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "SQD extra is missing"
msgstr "缺少 SQD 可选依赖"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Run `uv sync --frozen --extra sqd`"
msgstr "运行 `uv sync --frozen --extra sqd`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "SQD rejects the platform or thread settings"
msgstr "SQD 拒绝平台或线程设置"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "The calibrated executor requires Linux x86_64 and serial BLAS/OpenMP"
msgstr "校准执行器要求 Linux x86_64 和串行 BLAS/OpenMP"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Set all documented thread variables to `1` before Python starts. Use a supported host"
msgstr "在 Python 启动前将文档中列出的全部线程变量设为 `1`。使用支持的主机"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "SQD rejects a size or memory request"
msgstr "SQD 拒绝规模或内存请求"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "The request is outside the calibrated domain or reaches a host/user/hard cap"
msgstr "请求超出校准域，或达到主机、用户或硬上限"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid ""
"Reduce the documented active-space profile or budget. `allow_large` cannot bypass hard/domain "
"limits"
msgstr "减小文档规定的活性空间配置或预算。`allow_large` 无法绕过硬限制或域限制"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Very slow first MC run"
msgstr "首次 MC 运行很慢"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Catalyst is compiling QPE IR"
msgstr "Catalyst 正在编译 QPE IR"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Let the first compile finish, then reuse the cache"
msgstr "等待首次编译完成，然后复用缓存"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "H3O+ example is killed or times out"
msgstr "H3O+ 示例被终止或超时"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "H3O+ IR is much larger than H2 IR"
msgstr "H3O+ IR 远大于 H2 IR"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Use the H2 examples first. Lower Trotter depth or run on a larger machine"
msgstr "先使用 H2 示例。降低 Trotter 深度，或换用更大机器"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "GPU device is not selected"
msgstr "未选择 GPU 设备"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "CUDA, Lightning GPU, and JAX CUDA availability are separate checks"
msgstr "CUDA、Lightning GPU 和 JAX CUDA 的可用性分别检查"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Inspect `q2m3.core.device_utils` and fall back to `lightning.qubit` or `default.qubit`"
msgstr "检查 `q2m3.core.device_utils`，并回退到 `lightning.qubit` 或 `default.qubit`"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "QPE energy differs from HF by a large amount"
msgstr "QPE 能量与 HF 相差很大"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid "Low precision, phase wrapping, or Trotter error"
msgstr "精度低、相位回绕或 Trotter 误差"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:61
msgid ""
"Check estimation wires, `base_time`, energy shift, and Trotter depth before interpreting the "
"value as chemistry"
msgstr "解释其化学意义前，先检查估计线路数、`base_time`、能量平移和 Trotter 深度"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:117
msgid "Next Steps"
msgstr "后续步骤"

#: ../../source/getting-started.md:119
msgid ""
"Read [Core Concepts](core-concepts.md) for the scientific model. Then run the tutorials in order,"
" from H2 QPE validation through the three-mode solvation comparison."
msgstr "阅读[核心概念](core-concepts.md)了解科学模型，再按顺序运行从 H2 QPE 验证到三模式溶剂化比较的教程。"
